 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 334626,
   "is_answer_order_important": true,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<p><img src=\"exercises/media/6ce251868b6f4338.jpg\" alt=\"A table of with the codon and what amino acid it codes for, which correlate as follows: GCA - alanine, AAG - lysine, GUU - valine, AAU -asparagine, UGC - cysteine, UCG and UCU - serine, UUA - Leucine, and UAA - stop.\"></p>\n\n<p>You are given three mRNA sequences:</p>\n\n<ol>\n  <li>5’-UCG-GCA- AAU-UUA -GUU-3’</li>\n  <li>5’-UCU-GCA- AAU-UUA -GUU-3’</li>\n  <li>5’-UCU-GCA- AAU-UAA -GUU-3’</li>\n</ol>\n\n<p>Using the table, write the peptide encoded by each of the mRNA sequences.</p>\n",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 844134,
     "content_html": "<ol>\n  <li>Serine-alanine-asparagine-leucine-valine</li>\n  <li>Serine-alanine-asparagine-leucine-valine</li>\n  <li>Serine-alanine-asparagine(-stop)</li>\n</ol>\n"
    },
    {
     "id": 844131,
     "content_html": "<ol>\n  <li>Serine-phenylalanine-asparagine-leucine-valine</li>\n  <li>Serine-alanine-asparagine-leucine-valine</li>\n  <li>Serine-alanine-asparagine (-stop)</li>\n</ol>\n"
    },
    {
     "id": 844132,
     "content_html": "<ol>\n  <li>Serine-alanine-asparagine-leucine-valine</li>\n  <li>Serine-alanine-asparagine (-stop)</li>\n  <li>Serine-alanine-asparagine-leucine-valine</li>\n</ol>\n"
    },
    {
     "id": 844133,
     "content_html": "<ol>\n  <li>Serine-alanine-asparagine-leucine-valine</li>\n  <li>Serine-arginine-asparagine-leucine-valine</li>\n  <li>Serine-alanine-asparagine(-stop)</li>\n</ol>\n"
    }
   ],
